SteamGuard is an independent Tauri/Rust implementation derived from the local
authenticator behavior and export format of WattToolkit / SteamTools.

Reference project: https://github.com/BeyondDimension/SteamTools
Original authors: BeyondDimension and WattToolkit contributors.
This project retains GPL-3.0-only licensing; see LICENSE.

The WattToolkit embedded AES format parameters in import.rs are public client
format constants. They are not a user's authenticator secrets. Private exported
authenticators are never included in this repository.

Steam protocol definitions were checked against Valve protocol definitions mirrored in SteamDatabase/Protobufs, together with
ValvePython/steam and steam-session implementations.
